1,Gidar language - Wikipedia,https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gidar_language,"Gidar (Gidder), or Kaɗa, is a Biu–Mandara (Chadic) language of Cameroon and Chad. Gedar is spoken from Guider to the Chadian border in the Far North Region of Cameroon, in Mayo-Kani Department (arrondissements of Kaélé and Moutourwa), and in the North Region, Mayo-Louti Department. [3]",Gidar,Afro-Asiatic
